window.products.push({"id":665017,"name":"Moscow Mule Mugs - Handcrafted 100% Pure Solid Copper Hammered Finish 16 Oz Classic Mug - Premium Quality Gift Box Set of Two Cups with Bonus Coasters","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/919Zk+E8n-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"What is a Moscow Mule? A Moscow mule is a cocktail that was introduced in America in the 1940’s. Since those times this classic drink has become more and more known and popular. Today, it is the #1 trending cocktail in the market. You can now too be part of the trend and experience the true authentic way of drinking the Moscow Mule Cocktail with our premium Copper Mug set. How can you make the perfect Original Moscow Mule Drink? For that fresh and ice cold sensation, put your Copper Mugs in the freezer for 5 minutes. Then, simply, add lime juice, ice cubes, vodka, ginger beer into the mug and garnish with a lime wedge and mint, finally stir with our Copper Straw and set on the Wooden Coasters provided and you are ready to serve this delicious cocktail in your Copper mugs. Ingredients: (Per Serving) ½oz Lime Juice 2oz Vodka 5oz Ginger Beer 1 Lime Wedge 2 Fresh Mint Leaves 2 – 3 Ice Cubes 1 Chilled Copper Mug ENJOY!! How do you care for your Copper Mugs? To extend your products life cycle, it is recommend to follow the follows steps for best results: 1. Hand wash mugs and straws with soap and warm water after each use 2. Towel dry or leave to air dry on the counter 3. DO NOT place mugs in the dishwasher or microwave Buy with Confidence: MM Cocktails stands by its product, and wants its customers to have the best experience. Our main goal is to provide our customers with 100% satisfaction. If for any reason you don’t completely love your Copper Mug set, simply return them for a full refund. If you have any questions regarding the product, please contact us anytime and we will be happy to assist you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/919Zk+E8n-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MM Cocktails","source_asin":"B01KKOYDMQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-665017","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01KKOYDMQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01KKOYDMQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
