window.products.push({"id":665067,"name":"Woaboy Cooling Memory Foam Pillow for Neck Pain and Shoulder Relief Sleeping, Bamboo Pillowcase Absorb Sweat and Breathable, Adjustable Height Pillow ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GtFGvXsLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💤【Neck Pain Relief Pillow】: Made with 1 Blue Concavity Memory Foam and 2 support foams, environment friendly material, Neck pillows are well designed which conforms to the nature curve of your body, better support your head and neck to ensure comfort, keep air passages optimal for less snoring, and your lover can have a more restful sleep. 💤【Adjustable Height for Firm or Soft】: Height adjustable, meet your all loft needs. Unique trapezoidal shape design of contour bed pillow provides two different heights, just simply rotate the pillow 180 degrees to get a higher or lower contour pillow,and you can lower the pillow by removing the middle or bottom insert,you can find the most comfortable and suitable height! 💤【Cooling &Breathable Pillowcase】: The pillowcase is made of Q-max 0.4 Tech Cooling Fabric,which can feel better in the air-conditioned environment,The memory foam pillow fits the face nicely,good for stomach sleepers.The pillowcase is very soft and skin-friendly and will wick away your moistur，and the Mesh design on both sides allows heat to escape and fresh air to cycle in. Fully removable and machine washable,easy care. 💤【Perfect Neck Curve】: The cervical spine has a certain physiological curvature, Generally accepted physiological curvature ranges from 21 degrees to 22 degrees. Our memory foam cervical pillow is designed to relieve neck and shoulder pain by providing the correct sleeping posture, aligns your head, neck, shoulder and back. Bringing a reduction of stress in the cervical vertebra and spine.It can’t be used for diagnosis or treatment of any disease (e.g. cervical spondylosis) 🎁【Best Gifts & Service】: Package includes one 23.6\"×13.8\"×5.1\"/3.5\" memory foam pillow and one extra eye mask as your sleeping partner to encourage sound sleep all night long, This slow rebound memory foam cervical neck pillow is appropriate for all ages people for deeper sleep. Good gifts to show your care to somebody you concerned.We promise our quality products& customer service. If you do not enjoy the product, contact us directly to return the pillow for a full refund, no questions asked.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GtFGvXsLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Woaboy","source_asin":"B0C1S7NTTC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-665067","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C1S7NTTC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C1S7NTTC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":665068,"name":"Ziplock Bag Organizer - Premium Food Storage Bags Holder for Kitchen Drawer Organization - Compatible with Gallon, Quart, Sandwich and Snack Bags","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51aoWKCCD6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Most Premium Ziplock Bag Organizer Available On The Market. At Jolie Home Essentials, we take the time to design our products the right way. Our goal is to have your home and kitchen looking like it's straight out of a magazine, while also making your busy day to day life as easy and as organized as possible. Upon delivery please ensure that you check your email messages in your Amazon account for the PDF instruction manual. Absolutely Beautiful Design Jolie means pretty, and we know it looks way too good to keep in your drawer. But you'll probably want to hide it in there when guests are over to keep it from suddenly vanishing. Keep Your Kitchen Organized Say goodbye to those ugly boxes scattered in your drawer and on your counter. No room on your counter or in your drawers? No problem, hang it on the wall! No More Cracking or Separating Bamboo Engineered extremely strong acrylic can handle the busiest days in the kitchen. Permanent laser printed labels won’t peel off like stickers do. Easy Open Magnetic Lid Separate lid design eliminates those ugly hinges and loose sliding lids Round openings for quick and easy baggie grabbing. Is It Dishwasher Safe? We recommend cleaning the item with a warm damp soapy cloth or with some light all purpose kitchen cleaner and some paper towels. How Many Bags Can Fit In Each Compartment? The ziplock bag organizer will hold at least 1 full regular size box of food storage bags in each corresponding compartment from most if not all major brands. We Care About You! Everyone has their own unique needs. If you have any suggestions on how we can make our products more Jolie, please reach out to us!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51aoWKCCD6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jolie Home Essentials","source_asin":"B0B232DZ82","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-665068","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B232DZ82","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B232DZ82","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
