window.products.push({"id":665142,"name":"Moongiantgo Manual Wheatgrass Juicer Extractor Stainless Steel Manual Juicer for Juicing Wheat Grass Celery Kale Spinach Parsley Pomegranate Apple Gra","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":85.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BPN0Rv0PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MULTIPURPOSE MANUAL JUICER - Suitable for juicing Wheatgrass, Celery, Broccoli Sprouts, Kale, Spinach, Parsley, Pomegranate, Apple, Grapes, Orange and other Fruits / Vegetables. (Not recommended to squeeze the pulp that is too soft, such as flesh of coconut, tomatoes, mangoes, bananas. And sugar cane/carrot cannot be squeezed) ALL 304# STAINLESS STEEL - Our manual wheatgrass juicer is made by casting process, strong and durable, with the polished surface and unpolished interior. 【Note】Do not tighten the screw on the front slag outlet too much, just loosen a little, so that the slag can be discharged smoothly. Otherwise, the juice will easily leak out from behind. If the slag outlet is blocked, please reverse the handle several times first to help clean residues in the slag outlet. SEPARATE DESIGN FOR EASY CLEANING - After every use, remember to take the juicer apart and clean all parts with water directly, dry it, and assemble it for the next use. 【How to Disassemble Juicer】Unscrew the two screws of the back cover, remove the back cover, take out the auger and Use the handle or the auger to catch the protrusion of filter, then pull out the filter. MOUNTING CLAMP STYLE - Clamp the juicer body to the edge of the table, and tighten the bottom fixing screws so that the machine can clamp the table top and fix it firmly, leaving space for the handle to rotate (the thickness of the table must not be ＞5.5cm). Then, install the handle. PRECAUTIONS - 1. Before squeezing hard fruits such as apples/pears, it should cut into 2cm wide pieces, and then put them in. Squeezing something with a hard skin, peel it first! 2. Do not put too many materials into the juicer at one time. Add materials in small amounts and multiple times for better juicing. 3. Use the feeding rod to press the materials to help juicing. 4.Our store has other larger manual juicer for oranges citrus. (Search ASIN: B0872RMY1M)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BPN0Rv0PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Moongiantgo","source_asin":"B085LFP7LR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-665142","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085LFP7LR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B085LFP7LR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
