window.products.push({"id":665205,"name":"SOONYO 50PCS Green Room Decor Aesthetic Posters Wall Collage Kit,Boho Collage Kit Plant Room Decoration Green Wall Collage Kit for Teen Girls, Small P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/9190a5UPjZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Looking for something to spice up your wall, room, bedroom, dorm, party, or home? Well, look no further. We were fed up with the traditional small photo collage kits on the market. So we created something new and special with no compromises. Quality is our #1 priority, and that’s why each picture collage kit for wall aesthetic is handcrafted to make sure your wall becomes a new spectacle! Transform the look of your wall into something special. Each picture collage kit for wall aesthetic is printed using best-in-class 305gsm matte finish paper and follows the theme of hot summer city night vibes that will make you reminisce of the good old days of summer. With endless customization options, you can get creative with hanging the pictures and decorations. Note: We HIGHLY recommend you put tape or adhesive behind each image / photo. Do not tape the photos together and hang them. You can use regular scotch tape, poster putty, adhesive squares, thumb tacks or double-sided tape to hang your pictures on the wall. Just make sure you use wall-safe options. The aesthetic wall collage poster kit is a cute gift and room wall decoration for teens, baddie girls, daughter, scrapbook lovers, and college students. Click “Add to Cart” now and watch your new wall come to life!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/9190a5UPjZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SOONYO","source_asin":"B09SG7HFL8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-665205","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SG7HFL8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SG7HFL8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":665206,"name":"Paper Towel Holder 12 Inch -JSK Self Adhesive Paper Towel Rack Under Cabinet Mount for Kitchen Large Roll Paper Holder, Stainless Steel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QC03T78zL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Material: Premium 304 Stainless Steel Paper Towel Holder Total Length: The Paper Towel Bar Length: 12 inch, dimensions of the plate: 5.6 x 1.75 inch. Package Includes: Paper roll holder x 1 Convenient and frees up counter space JSK European-style open-arm design is easy to replace the new paper roll, very suitable for use in all areas of the kitchen, Such as under the cabinet, cabinet door, the side of the hearth, and near the sink. Self-adhesive paper towel holder There is a powerful self-adhesive strip on the holder back, strong viscosity, no drilling, no surface damage Accommodates all sizes of paper towel rack Based on the practical design of the size, absolutely suitable for the American kitchen paper towel roll.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QC03T78zL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JSK","source_asin":"B08L51DG5W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-665206","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08L51DG5W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08L51DG5W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":665207,"name":"Santa Barbara Design Studio That's All Ceramic Mug, Better Than Everyone Else","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61t5vqwZtFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Curing cancer while laughing out loud. Karen Rosen Zweig, while staying in the hospital with her sister, who was diagnosed with Stage 3 Ovarian Cancer, created a line of greeting cards and not your everyday run of the mill ones. You see, Karen believes there are times in life when you need to spin tall tales with fancy language and fluffy phrases and this collection, is NOT for those times. This collection is for the times when less is more, when you need the power of reality combined with laughter to help you through because, well, laughter just might be the best medicine! Original, edgy, hilarious greeting card sentiments now on shot glasses, mugs and wine glasses to remind you of the humor in a situation, every day. That's All Ceramic Mug collections say it like it is. Back to basics. Simple sayings with great messages! And even better, a portion of all proceeds goes to the fight against ovarian cancer. Ceramic mug is approximately 4-1/4 Inch tall and hold 16 ounces. Printed mug is microwave and dishwasher safe and has the words \"That's All\" printed inside the rim to remind you that sometimes, it really is that simple. Who do you think of when you read the outside of the mug, could they use some laughter today.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61t5vqwZtFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Santa Barbara Design Studio","source_asin":"B00TZG2SDM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-665207","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00TZG2SDM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00TZG2SDM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
