window.products.push({"id":665216,"name":"LEDwholesalers 12-Volt 16.4-ft RGB Color-Changing LED Flexible Strip with 150xSMD5050 and Water-Resistant Silicone-Gel Coating, 2038RGB-R2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41IiLA-NdxL._AC_.jpg","description":"This high quality, water-resistant, flexible color-changing LED strip is perfect for nearly any applications including mood and accent lighting. It features 150 SMD5050 RGB LEDs. The entire roll is 16.4 feet in length, and is cuttable. When used with an RGB controller (sold separately) one can control the color output including solid colors (red, green, blue, etc.) gradient fading, and blinking. This strip produces vibrant colors while at the same time being very energy efficient and not consuming a lot of power. Note * Minimum bending radius: 5cm (2\"). * Unroll LED strip completely before powering on. * Unused wires of the LED strip must be isolated to prevent potential short circuit. * Test all components before cutting or permanently mounting the strip. Cut end should be sealed with silicone caulk or similar product if used in damp location. * Do not lengthen the LED strip by directly connecting additional strips to it; additional lengths should be wired in parallel (power supply and controller must be of adequate capacity). Specifications * LED Quantity/Type: 150x SMD5050 RGB * Input Voltage: 12 VDC * Power: 21.3 W * Beam Angle: 120º * Dimmable: Yes * IP Rating: IP65 * Pin Order: +RGB * PCB Color: White * Width: 10 mm * Length: 16.4 ft (5 m) * Wire Leads: 22 AWG * Compliance: CE, RoHS * Life Expectancy: 35,000 h * Warranty: 1 year","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41IiLA-NdxL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LEDwholesalers","source_asin":"B003UYL23C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-665216","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003UYL23C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003UYL23C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
