window.products.push({"id":665228,"name":"Hannoonaco Wrap Organizer with Cutter 2 in 1 Plastic Wrap, Aluminum Foil and Wax Parchment Paper Oak Dispenser Cling for Kitchen Storage Organization ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712dtC98oYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you tired of looking at messy cluttered drawers? Are you tired of fighting with cling wrap and the trouble of cutting it with scissors?Then, this wrap dispenser with a cutter is the perfect addition to your kitchen!YOU TALKED AND WE LISTENED! Our oak wrap dispenser is the new improved design with the following features:The wrap dispenser is made from 100% durable, eco-friendly, and ethically sourced oak- certified by The Forest Stewardship Council (FSC). Oak is one of the strongest woods there is and you don’t have to worry about chipping or breaking.The oak plastic wrap dispenser has 2 built-in slide cutters for 2 slots that can smoothly cut wraps without hurting your hands. The blades are made of durable high-quality steel that ensures a perfectly smooth cut every single time.The oak wood dispenser is compatible with aluminium foil, parchment wax paper, and other conventional size rolls less than 12 inches in length.The oak wrap organizer has a sliding magnetic door so you can easily refill your wraps.There are hanging holes on the back of the foil and plastic wrap roll organizer if you wish to hang it on the wall. Oak gives your kitchen warmth and beauty. Or you can store it neatly in the drawer, cabinet, or pantry.How to Use:☑ Open the sliding magnetic door of the wrap dispenser, then put the wraps in the roll paper organizer.☑ Grab the wrap opening from the big designated openings of the oak wrap dispenser, then slide the cutter to cut the wraps as desired.Gift yourself this beautiful oak wood dispenser to use for organization and storage purposes, or you can gift it to someone for their birthday, or Christmas, or even make it part of the wedding registry!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712dtC98oYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hannoonaco","source_asin":"B0B63YYNFC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-665228","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B63YYNFC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B63YYNFC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":665229,"name":"Village Candle Clementine Evergreen, Medium Bowl Scented Candle, 14 oz, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.19,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41RrDwtjCaL._AC_.jpg","description":"Village Candle Clementine Evergreen, Medium Bowl, 14 net ounces with notes of citrus, and fresh cut balsam. Whether the sun is shining or there's a few inches of snow on the ground, infuse your space with a beautiful medley of luscious ripe clementine, fresh cut balsam and tart citrus notes. A great transitional fragrance this fragrance will brighten your day and uplift your mood becoming your new everyday staple. About Us: Proudly produced in America, Village Candles are made with care, trimmed by hand, and artfully crafted for each and every consumer. Each candle is crafted with the most refined food grade paraffin wax– maintaining the highest quality standards. Our fragrances are a blend of fine fragrance and pure essential oils. It’s what’s inside that makes the difference and brings a clean, true-to-life long-lasting fragrance experience. Village Candle's more than 75 fragranced candles in various sizes provide the best in home decor with their ability to enhance life's moments and add ambiance to any living space. Treat yourself to Village Candle, because you deserve the best. Made in the USA and part of the award winning Stonewall Kitchen Family of Brands, these candles brighten homes and hearts around the world.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41RrDwtjCaL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Village Candle","source_asin":"B08J1SKMB4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-665229","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08J1SKMB4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08J1SKMB4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
