window.products.push({"id":665319,"name":"Fima Hand Painted Italian Ceramic Medium Rectangular Tray Ricco Deruta Blu - Handmade in Deruta","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81W2q-TIqYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A recently introduced new color variant for the Ricco Deruta, the perfect summary of Deruta Renaissance creative genius. The Renaissance pottery makers who created Ricco Deruta were certainly inspired by the decorations of great contemporary painters, such as Raphael and his master Pietro Vannucci called the Perugino. The Ricco Deruta Blu pottery collection consists of a full range of dinnerware, serveware and kitchenware. Fima is a small, family run company based in Deruta, Italy. Their pottery is handmade using traditional techniques with high quality materials. Their production is completely carried out within the company, from clay shaping and decoration to kiln firing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81W2q-TIqYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fima","source_asin":"B005GJGFEU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-665319","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005GJGFEU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005GJGFEU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":665320,"name":"Zeroll Ussentials Stainless Steel Cheese Planer, Bubble Gum (Discontinued by Manufacturer)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Hz7WJPf4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If you are looking to cut mouth watering slices of cheese for your appetizer tray, this is an ideal tool. The Ussentials Stainless Steel Cheese Planer has a sharp solid yet flexible blade that easily slides through all types of cheese. An oversized no slip handle gives users control and the ability to cut the brick form any angle. Stainless steel construction, a comfort conscious design, and dishwasher safe materials make it a dependable user friendly tool that will perform smoothly through the years. Like all Ussentials, the cheese planer is dishwasher safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Hz7WJPf4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zeroll","source_asin":"B005KPFVTU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-665320","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005KPFVTU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005KPFVTU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":665321,"name":"Sunshine Joy Grateful Dead Dancing Bear Tapestry Blue & Purple 30x45 Inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TUh8-HJPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Grateful Dead Kaleidoscopic Dancing Bears--Friendly and welcoming, everyone loves the bears...One of the most powerful bands of all time, they meant so much, to so many people, in so many ways.--Designed as wall hanging art, our tapestries have many uses  In India, they are what locals use as bedcovers. People use them at home for tablecloths, bed-sheets, room dividers, curtains, super hero capes, window treatments, ceiling decor and to quickly cover large piles of dirty laundry.--The corner loops make our tapestries the perfect multipurpose outdoor traveling companion.  Secure your picnic sheet down at the park.  At festivals, stake out an appropriate amount of space for your friends. Tie up a sunscreen at the campsite.  Add some privacy to your car. Great at the beach as a windproof beach sheet or sun cover-up.--Quality Construction -100% Cotton - Our tapestries are printed, not quilted or woven. They are hippie Indian tapestries.  Thin as sheet.  Good, tight power loom construction. Hemmed edges.--The printing process is unique to India. Each tapestry has its unique imperfections.  In some cases what printers would call registration errors are intentionally included on the screen print to simulate hand woodblock prints.--Sunshine Joy's tapestries are printed with a special soft fiber reactive dye.  This is the same soft feeling of your favorite tie-dyed T-shirt.  Some colors may show through the back side to give the impression that they are double sided with one side lighter than the other. Actually, they are only printed on one side.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TUh8-HJPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sunshine Joy","source_asin":"B00KAIIP90","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-665321","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00KAIIP90","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00KAIIP90","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
