window.products.push({"id":665530,"name":"Jaxx Saxx 3 Foot Bean Bag Chair with Removable Cover, Cinnabar","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":159.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719pxW58zFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Kids of all sizes love the look and feel of the Jaxx 3 ft Bean Bag Chair. Filled with finely shredded polyurethane foam and covered with soft yet durable Microsuede, this chair redefines “Bean Bag”. This round bean bag gives kids a comfortable seating option that conforms to their body in a variety of positions and is easy to move and reposition. Available in a variety of colors, our Microsuede covers are both removable and machine-washable. Each bean bag includes a protective inner-liner with childproof zipper that keeps the filling out of reach when cleaning the cover. To clean the cover, wash with cold water and tumble dry on low heat.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719pxW58zFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jaxx","source_asin":"B00P9TJD00","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-665530","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00P9TJD00","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00P9TJD00","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
