window.products.push({"id":665554,"name":"Elegear 100% Bamboo Cooling Blanket for Hot Sleepers, Absorbs Heat to Keep Cool, Ultra-Cool Breathable Summer Blanket, Queen Size Super Soft Lightweig","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91hZBJEtc3S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Keep You Cool All Night - Do you regularly find yourself tossing and turning in bed due to the heat? Or suffering from the heat lead to sweating and sticky so that restless? Don't worry, Elegear bamboo cooling Blankets will help you with these problems! Our bamboo cooling blankets can quickly absorbs body heat and reduce body temperature by 2-4 degrees, keeping you cool all night. Especially suitable for those suffering from hot flashes and night sweats. Breathable & Moisture Wicking - The lightweight blanket is made of 100% natural bamboo fiber fabric, which is a new type of fiber fabric made of bamboo as raw material through a special process. The cross section of this fabric is full of large and small pores, which can instantly absorb and evaporate a large amount of water, and has super breathability and moisture absorption. The water absorption of bamboo fiber is three times that of cotton, so it is called \"breathing fiber\". Hypoallergenic - Bamboo fiber fabric is a natural environmentally friendly fabric, which is very skin-friendly and safe, does not contain harmful chemicals, and is also very friendly to sensitive people. The bamboo blanket also has the natural beauty effect of bamboo, anti-odor, anti-ultraviolet and so on. Bamboo fiber blanket feels silky and comfortable, and also has unique resilience and strong wear resistance. A Perfect Home Decoration - Our bamboo blankets are available in 4 colors (gray, blue, white and beige), simple and generous pattern weaving, can perfectly match your home style.These blankets are the perfect decoration for your living room, bedroom and office for bed or sofa. This summer blanket is machine washable and super easy to care for. Package List & Gift Ideas - Bamboo fiber blankets are suitable for all seasons to use. Using this blanket in summer and autumn can make people feel particularly cool and breathable; In winter and spring, it can make you feel very fluffy and comfortable, while removing excess heat and moisture from the body. It's perfect for gift giving.You can give this summer blanket as a gift to your dad, mom, wife, husband, daughter or friends at any event or festival.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91hZBJEtc3S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Elegear","source_asin":"B0BG8S3B19","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-665554","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BG8S3B19","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BG8S3B19","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
