window.products.push({"id":665688,"name":"VK-6067B Filter Compatible with Vremi Air Purifier Filter Replacement and Hokeki Air Purifier Filter Replacement for VK-6067B H13 True HEPA Air Purifi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91zBeIFeqbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💯[ COMPATIBLE BRANDS ] ┅ VK-6067B filter is absolutely compatible with Vremi air purifier filter repaclement and Hokeki air purifier filter replacement. Model number is vk-6067b H13 true HEPA filter, also for Honkeeki Brillante Toyuugo voremy air purifier to maintain its peak performance, work just like the original one that come with unit. Please check it carefully to ensure vk-6067b or vk-6067a is the correct filter for you. Dimensions: 6.93 x 6.93 x 6.97 inches. 💯 [ ULTRA-FINE PRE-FILTER ] ┅ Our vk-6067b filter uses ultra-fine nylon pre-filter captures the common large particles in air, such as dust, lint, hair, fibers, dander and pet fur. Using it can help you maximize extend the filter’s life, and let you always enjoy the fresh air. 💯 [ H13 GRADE TRUE HEPA FILTER ] ┅ VK-6067B H13 true HEPA filter captures finer particles of 0.3 microns or larger better than true HEPA filter. Avoid coughing, sneezing caused by airborne pollutants, creating fresh and purified air for your family. Providing a certain guarantee for the high quality air in the room and the health of your family. 💯 [ HIGH-EFFCIENCY ACTIVATED CARBON ] ┅ The Activated Carbon Layer of our VK-6067B can captures various unfavorable odors and fume, such as cigarette smoke, cooking smells and filtering volatile organic compounds (VOCs), also can absorb and transform various bad odors especially for pets odors and dander, and effectively improve the air cleanliness. 💰 [ PREMIUM QUALITY & AFFORDABLE PRICE ] ┅ We deliver premium, durable VK-6067B replacements that has the same quality as the original ones while they are more affordable, allowing air filter to last more longer with less cost. Long term use of DAJDAH VK-6067B filter, it will save a lot of money. ⏳ [ LONG LASTING ] ┅ In order to improve the performance of the air purifier, please replace the vk-6067b filter every 6-8 months or depending on the usage and environment. The affordable price makes it possible to change frequently. ☎️ [ CUSTOMER-FRIENDLY ] ┅ If you have any questions or problems on DAJDAH VK-6067B filter at any time don’t hesitate to give us a call or E-mail, DAJDAH customer support team are here to help! Customer satisfaction is our goal forever.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91zBeIFeqbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DAJDAH","source_asin":"B0C2BL8TZW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-665688","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C2BL8TZW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C2BL8TZW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
