window.products.push({"id":665824,"name":"OVENTE Electric Bagless Canister Vacuum, High Efficiency Particulate Air Filtration System, Automatic Cable Rewind, Floor & Furniture Nozzle, Pet/Sofa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51AUwoyWaAL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"All-Around Cleaning Buddy Tired wiping off stubborn stains from couches, dusting the fixtures, removing cobwebs from the ceiling, and mopping pet dander—most homeowners would agree that cleaning the house is the most tedious of all chores. Not to mention that they require heaps of prep like making baking soda–vinegar mixtures and washing and rewashing microfiber cloths. Good thing we do not have to polish everything every single day to keep the house in shipshape! The Ovente’s Cyclonic Bagless Vacuum collects all the big and ultra small dirt in one go! With its multiple attachments, this lightweight appliance can save you a week’s worth of tidying up. Clean Home, Healthy Home This vacuum is engineered with a high efficiency particulate air filtration system that can trap dirt and debris such as hair, clothing fibers, bits of dead bugs, pollen, and etc. Also it can also suck small particles as small as 0.3 μm and make sure that these particles collected will not be released back in the air. This ensures that you can keep a healthy clean home! Cleaning Will be as Easy as 1-2-3! The Ovente ST2620 Vacuum is equipped with 1400 watts and comes with a variety of premium attachments. This includes - a floor nozzle with two settings: extended brushes perfect for cleaning hard surfaces like parquet flooring and flooring tiles and retracted brushes for carpets; crevice & bristle brush made for radiators, corners and skirting boards; a furniture nozzle that is great for curtains, shelves and other furnitures; a pet/sofa brush that can effectively remove fur and hair from your upholsteries; and a multi-angle brush perfectly made for high-reaching ceilings and furniture tops. Cleaning Your House Will Never Feel Like a Chore This comes with an automatic cable rewind. Simply press your foot onto the pedal to retract the cord back into the base of the vacuum. It also comes with a translucent dust compartment, 360° hose swivel, bendable & adjustable telescopic stainless steel wand, 1. 5-m crush-proof hose with airflow control on the handle and easy-to-clean filter and container.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51AUwoyWaAL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OVENTE","source_asin":"B07TKDYQ25","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-665824","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TKDYQ25","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TKDYQ25","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
