window.products.push({"id":665905,"name":"Rucas 9 Inch Memory Foam and Pocket Spring Hybrid-Mattress in a Box - Soft Feel-Supportive & Pressure Relief- CertiPUR-US Certified Foam-Queen-60\" X 8","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Rch+GxdjL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"Feel the pressure-relieving comfort in your sleep. Features layers of 2 inch durable Memory Foam,2 inch high density foam & 7 inch Pocket Spring for Instant recovery for sleep. Individually wrapped coils encased in separate pockets, they move independently, reduce the sensation of movement, provide the targeted support to your body, proper back support & alignment.So you will have a substantial, deep-down feel not often found in traditional memory foam.Size:60\" L x 80\" W x 9\" D; ★HEALTH & HYPOALLERGENIC MATTRESS: The foam has been certified by CertiPUR-US and Oeko-Tex Standard 111 without harmful substances like formaldehyde, mercury, and other heavy metals. ★COMFORTABLE & BREA: RUCAS Queen Mattress provides the best of both worlds-the comfort of a memory foam top layer with the support of a traditional spring coil base layer. The memory foam mattresses help align your spine as you sleep, and keep health. A cozy layer of memory foam is quilted in the soft, knit fabric mattress cover. The innovative style and design allows the air to flow freely from the memory foam mattress & innerspring mattress and thus it allows you to breathe normally in sleep. ★EASY SHIPPING & SET-UP:Queen Bed Mattress is compressed and packaged in a box for shipping, allowing it to easily be delivered to your door and expand to its full lofty shape inside your home. They fit all frames, such as box spring, floor, slatted base, flat platform or adjustable bed, hospital bed. ★NO RISK WARRANTY: We offer a 15-Year Guarantee to make you feel confident of our quality. You around the world who have decided a superior full mattress can make the difference in the quality of sleep they enjoy. For any problems, you can contact us and we will reply you immediately to solve all of your worries. This memory foam mattress will give you the best sleep experience. You can enjoy 100 hassle-free nights trail to confirm our quality and durability.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Rch+GxdjL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rucas","source_asin":"B08JPGTN5J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-665905","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08JPGTN5J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08JPGTN5J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
